Implementation note
  The wrapper resolves query_vector once, validates/quotes identifiers and scalar
  filters, then calls a C SPI materialization helper.  Materialization is required
  because a PL/pgSQL cursor lifecycle around a parallel HybridRecall query corrupted
  stream metadata; SPI_execute_with_args drives one complete ExecutorRun lifecycle.

